{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01TNi72fJspMKRkJcDaGkmYf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to define three tiers (best/median/worst) for Dream simulation scenarios based on the ratekv research project. Let me analyze the context carefully.\n\nKey information:\n- Project: ratekv - per-head KV cache quantization via constrained MCKP\n- Target: EMNLP 2026 Main, ARR May 25 deadline (11 days away)\n- Current results on Qwen2.5-7B: constrained MCKP PPL 11.23 vs uniform 4-bit PPL 15.45 (27% improvement), unconstrained MCKP PPL 36.92\n\n\n- Hand-designed oracle achieves PPL 11.69, establishing a strong upper bound\n- Three core claims to validate: head sensitivity heterogeneity, constrained MCKP superiority, and cardinality constraints as regularization\n- Key risks include potential incrementality concerns over RateQuant, single-model evaluation, abandoned eviction approach, and profiler resolution limitations\n- Experiment pipeline spans 13 planned studies with several currently running or in preparation stages\n\nNow I'm thinking through what constitutes each tier for the Dream scenarios.\n\nBest case would have all three claims hold across multiple models with a clean compounding effect, high-resolution profiling uncovering new structural insights, and the solver naturally discovering L0 sensitivity without needing explicit constraints. Median case involves partial replication across architectures with smaller improvements and a less crisp compounding story. Worst case sees poor cross-model transfer or significant margin shrinkage, though the work could still target EMNLP with a reframed narrative.\n\nI need to track several key metrics: PPL gains relative to uniform baseline across different models, the gap between constrained and unconstrained MCKP variants as evidence of compounding, consistency of sensitivity patterns across architectures, whether the solver auto-discovers L0 protection, and stability across budget sweeps. Now I'm working through the number ranges for the YAML configuration. Looking at the median and worst-case scenarios, I see the key risk is that L0 auto-discovery might not generalize across models, and the compounding effect could be noisy or weak. The critical metrics I need to track are the PPL improvement percentage as my headline result, the gap between constrained and unconstrained MCKP as evidence for the compounding claim, how consistently the pattern replicates across Llama and Mistral, and whether the solver actually discovers the L0 threshold without needing an explicit constraint.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9599,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9599},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4a3d4890-c310-456b-8c58-b81454db520c","uuid":"68f436fa-264c-481d-ae2f-d61cc0df26fa"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01TNi72fJspMKRkJcDaGkmYf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntiers:\n  best:\n    meaning: \"所有三条 claims 在多模型、多数据集上完整成立；compounding effect 有干净的 elbow curve；solver 无需 L0 先验即自动发现关键 head\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - plan_001 成功：去掉 L0 exclusion 后 solver 仍自动分配 8-bit 给 Layer 0 heads\n      - plan_002/003 成功：Llama-3.1-8B 和 Mistral-7B 上 constrained MCKP 均显著优于 uniform（≥20% PPL improvement）\n      - plan_004 成功：max_2bit sweep 产生干净的 elbow curve（PPL 在某个 k 值后急剧恶化，SNR ≥ 5）\n      - plan_006 成功：高分辨率 profiling 能区分 mid-layer heads（delta=0 的 head 比例从 84% 降到 <60%）\n      - plan_007 成功：C4 上结果与 WikiText-2 一致（rank correlation ≥ 0.9）\n      - 跨模型 L0 dominance pattern 一致复现\n    number_ranges:\n      qwen_constrained_ppl_wikitext: [10.5, 11.3]\n      qwen_uniform4bit_ppl_wikitext: [15.0, 15.5]\n      qwen_ppl_improvement_pct: [25, 32]\n      llama_ppl_improvement_pct: [20, 30]\n      mistral_ppl_improvement_pct: [18, 28]\n      unconstrained_mckp_ppl: [30, 45]\n      compounding_elbow_k: [6, 16]\n      hires_nonzero_head_pct: [45, 70]\n      c4_rank_correlation_with_wikitext: [0.88, 0.98]\n      l0_auto_discovery: true\n    narrative_direction: >\n      原始 framing 完全成立。三条 claims 无需调整。标题强调 \"cardinality-constrained MCKP \n      as principled regularization for compounding effects\"。核心卖点：(1) 发现 compounding effect \n      并给出干净的实证 characterization，(2) 约束型 MCKP 在多模型多数据集上一致优于 uniform 和 \n      unconstrained，(3) solver 自动发现 architectural sensitivity structure。\n      与 RateQuant 的差异化叙事强：discrete vs continuous + compounding regularization \n      是 qualitatively different contribution，不是 incremental improvement。\n\n  median:\n    meaning: \"核心机制成立但跨模型泛化有折扣；compounding curve 存在但 elbow 不够锐利；部分 claim 需降低强度\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - plan_001 部分成功：solver 给 L0 分配 ≥4-bit 但未必是 8-bit（仍优于 uniform 但自动发现 story 弱化）\n      - plan_002/003 部分成功：一个模型改进 ≥15%，另一个只有 8-15%（GQA ratio 差异导致）\n      - plan_004 部分成功：compounding trend 存在但 elbow 模糊（PPL 逐渐恶化而非阶跃，需要更复杂的建模）\n      - plan_006 效果有限：hires profiling 改善 mid-layer 区分但 delta=0 比例仍 >65%\n      - plan_007 成功但数值不同：C4 上 improvement 存在但幅度小于 WikiText-2（15-20% vs 27%）\n      - L0 dominance 在 2/3 模型上复现\n    number_ranges:\n      qwen_constrained_ppl_wikitext: [11.0, 12.0]\n      qwen_uniform4bit_ppl_wikitext: [15.0, 15.5]\n      qwen_ppl_improvement_pct: [22, 27]\n      llama_ppl_improvement_pct: [10, 20]\n      mistral_ppl_improvement_pct: [8, 18]\n      unconstrained_mckp_ppl: [20, 35]\n      compounding_elbow_k: [8, 24]\n      hires_nonzero_head_pct: [30, 50]\n      c4_rank_correlation_with_wikitext: [0.70, 0.88]\n      l0_auto_discovery: \"partial (≥4-bit but not always 8-bit)\"\n    narrative_direction: >\n      Claim 1（heterogeneity）和 Claim 2（MCKP outperforms uniform）完整保留。\n      Claim 3（cardinality as regularization）从 \"principled regularization\" 降级为 \n      \"effective heuristic with empirical motivation\"——compounding effect 是真实的，\n      但 elbow 不够 sharp 意味着最优 k 的确定需要模型-specific 调参而非 universal rule。\n      标题转向 \"discrete mixed-precision KV cache quantization via constrained MCKP\"，\n      弱化 regularization story，强化 practical system contribution。\n      补充一个 \"sensitivity to k\" analysis 表格，诚实展示 k 在 ±50% 范围内 PPL 变化幅度，\n      论证方法对 k 选择 robust enough for practical use。\n      RateQuant 差异化仍成立但需要更 nuanced 的讨论——承认 continuous waterfilling \n      在某些 regime 可能 competitive，discrete MCKP 的优势集中在 extreme compression ratios。\n\n  worst:\n    meaning: \"跨模型泛化失败或改进幅度不显著；compounding effect 在其他模型上不复现；核心叙事需要 reframe\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - plan_001 失败：去掉 L0 exclusion 后 solver 产生明显劣化的分配（PPL 恶化 >10%），说明 profiler 信号不足以自动发现 L0\n      - plan_002/003 至少一个失败：某模型上 constrained MCKP vs uniform 改进 <8%，或者 unconstrained MCKP 没有 catastrophic failure（削弱 compounding 论点）\n      - plan_004 部分失败：compounding curve 在其他模型上消失或不单调，暗示 compounding 是 Qwen-specific artifact\n      - plan_006 失败：hires profiling 无实质改善，profiler resolution 仍然是 fundamental limitation\n      - plan_007 失败：C4 上改进 <10% 或排序不一致（rank corr < 0.65）\n      - L0 dominance 是 Qwen-specific，其他模型有不同 sensitivity pattern\n    number_ranges:\n      qwen_constrained_ppl_wikitext: [11.0, 12.5]\n      qwen_uniform4bit_ppl_wikitext: [15.0, 15.5]\n      qwen_ppl_improvement_pct: [19, 27]\n      llama_ppl_improvement_pct: [3, 10]\n      mistral_ppl_improvement_pct: [2, 10]\n      unconstrained_mckp_ppl: [14, 25]\n      compounding_elbow_k: \"no clear elbow on non-Qwen models\"\n      hires_nonzero_head_pct: [20, 40]\n      c4_rank_correlation_with_wikitext: [0.45, 0.70]\n      l0_auto_discovery: false\n    narrative_direction: >\n      原始 framing 的三条 claims 都无法原样保留。Reframe 方向：\n      从 \"general method paper\" 转为 \"empirical analysis paper with method contribution\"。\n      新核心叙事：\"Per-head KV cache sensitivity is architecture-dependent: \n      we provide the first systematic characterization across model families, reveal that \n      compounding effects are GQA-ratio-dependent, and show that constrained discrete \n      optimization is necessary (but the right constraints are model-specific).\"\n      具体操作：(1) 将 Qwen 的成功结果作为 strong positive case study 而非 general claim；\n      (2) 将跨模型差异作为 finding 本身（\"sensitivity structure varies with GQA ratio\"\n      是有价值的 empirical contribution）；(3) 将 \"universal cardinality constraint\" \n      降级为 \"model-specific constraint selection via small-scale compounding test\"；\n      (4) 强调 MCKP framework 的 flexibility（能适应不同模型的不同 constraint structure）\n      而非 specific constraint choice 的 universality。\n      仍冲 EMNLP Main，但 positioning 从 \"efficient method\" 转向 \n      \"empirical analysis + practical framework\"，更接近 analysis paper 而非 pure method paper。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9599,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9599},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4a3d4890-c310-456b-8c58-b81454db520c","uuid":"e3ee34af-09e8-47f0-a668-af4e00d1c541"}
